  "description": "The second part of <i>Genjitsu Shugi Yuusha no Oukoku Saikenki</i>.<br>\n<br>\nSummoned to a fantasy world, Kazuya Souma is ruling a kingdom with a nontraditional (and very human) route of administrative reform. He’s tackling food shortages, mastering dark magic, and dazzling a few ladies along the way. Despite his latest good intentions, Kazuya breaks the ban on war to defeat a military dictatorship. Now, he must answer to the Gran Chaos Empire’s idealistic leader…uh oh.<br>\n<br>\n(Source: Funimation)",
